NAME
       tar - list or extract a ustar archive

SYNOPSIS
       tar -t|-x [-v] -f archive.tar [-C dir]

DESCRIPTION
       Reads a ustar archive. Creating archives is not supported.

OPTIONS
       -t     list the contents
       -x     extract
       -v     name each member as it is processed
       -f F   the archive to read
       -C D   change to D before extracting

EXAMPLES
       tar -tvf initramfs.tar
       tar -xf archive.tar -C /mnt

SEE ALSO
       dd(1)
